sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 用户
    participant API as ⚙️ Ingestion API
    participant DB as 💾 PostgreSQL
    participant Broker as 📬 Celery Broker
    participant Worker as ⚙️ Celery Worker
    participant Source as 🌐 视频平台

    User->>+API: 保存视频 URL
    API->>API: 规范化 URL / 校验用户权限

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over API,DB: Admission transaction
        API->>+DB: 检查 ContentItem 是否已存在
        DB-->>-API: 不存在 / 已存在
        API->>DB: 写入 ContentItem(state=pending)
        API->>DB: 写入 IngestDispatch(attempt=1, state=pending)
        Note over DB: 唯一约束 + request_key<br/>防止重复入库
        DB-->>-API: COMMIT
    end

    API-->>-User: 已接收，等待处理

    API->>+Broker: 发布 fetch_text_task(dispatch_id)
    alt Broker 发布成功
        Broker-->>-API: 返回 task_id
        API->>+DB: 将 dispatch 更新为 enqueued
        DB-->>-API: COMMIT
    else Broker 发布失败或超时
        Broker-->>-API: Error / timeout
        API->>+DB: 将 dispatch 更新为 failed<br/>error_code=queue_unavailable
        DB-->>-API: COMMIT
        Note over API,DB: 后续 retry 创建新的 attempt
    end

    Broker-)Worker: 投递 dispatch_id
    Worker->>+DB: 按 dispatch_id 加锁并 claim
    alt 已被其他 worker 处理
        DB-->>Worker: duplicate / no-op
    else 可以处理
        DB-->>-Worker: state=running
        Worker->>+Source: 拉取标题、章节、字幕
        Source-->>-Worker: 内容或可重试错误
        alt 抓取失败且可重试
            Worker->>+DB: dispatch 回到 enqueued
            DB-->>-Worker: COMMIT
            Note over Worker,Broker: Celery retry with backoff
        else 抓取成功
            Worker->>Worker: 分块、生成 embedding、写入 segments
            Worker->>+DB: 更新 ContentItem=ready<br/>dispatch=completed
            DB-->>-Worker: COMMIT
        else 不可恢复失败
            Worker->>+DB: ContentItem=failed<br/>dispatch=failed
            DB-->>-Worker: COMMIT
        end
    end

    Note over User,Source: ContentItem 是用户收藏的内容实体；<br/>IngestDispatch 是一次异步处理尝试和状态记录。
